// and Warm Ashes' raiders (systems/seaRaiders.js) are born of the land and the shared clock, the same for everyone with
// no word said - but one a player FOUGHT or ESCAPED (spent) was told peer to peer, on a foes frame's `bd`, to the players
// within RANGE_PIXELS at that moment and to nobody after; and a spawned dungeon's two clocks (world/spawnedDungeons.js
// TTL1: gone two game days after it was cleared, seven after it was first seen) were each client's own, so two players
